@startuml client_connection_send_with_callback_activity
title ClientConnection - sending with a reply callback

start
:SendWithCallback(message, callback);
:sends_.SendWithCallback(message, move(callback));
:Return the helper result unchanged;
stop

legend
    ClientSendQueue owns admission and reply/cancellation ownership.
    The facade transfers the callback without duplicating helper synchronization.
endlegend

@enduml